  "title": "Hawaiian Ham and Cheese Sliders",
  "description": "The best Hawaiian sliders with ham, cheese, sweet rolls, and a buttery poppy seed sauce. These are perfect for potlucks and quick and easy to prepare.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Gee"
  ],
